  "statement": "With $\\Xi(\\psi)=\\{x^2/d_A : x\\in{\\rm Spec}(\\psi_A)\\}$ the probability distribution associated with the Pauli spectrum, $M_\\alpha(\\psi_A):=\\frac{1}{1-\\alpha}\\log\\left(\\sum_{x\\in{\\rm Spec}(\\psi_A)}\\frac{x^{2\\alpha}}{d_A}\\right)$."
